WEBVTT

00:00:17.473 --> 00:00:20.215
[ GASPING ]

00:00:35.926 --> 00:00:37.058
CONFRINGO!

00:00:47.068 --> 00:00:50.419
[ BIRDS CHIRPING ]

00:01:04.868 --> 00:01:07.479
[ SIGHS ]

00:01:12.136 --> 00:01:15.444
[ HARRY PANTING ]

00:01:16.793 --> 00:01:19.535
WOW.

00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:22.364
ARE YOU FEELING BETTER?

00:01:24.584 --> 00:01:27.456
YOU'VE OUTDONE YOURSELF
THIS TIME, HERMIONE.

00:01:27.499 --> 00:01:30.198
THE FOREST OF DEAN.

00:01:30.241 --> 00:01:33.027
I CAME HERE ONCE
WITH MUM AND DAD...

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:35.812
YEARS AGO.

00:01:35.856 --> 00:01:38.249
IT'S JUST
HOW I REMEMBER IT.

00:01:38.293 --> 00:01:40.600
THE TREES, THE RIVER --

00:01:40.643 --> 00:01:42.297
EVERYTHING.

00:01:42.340 --> 00:01:45.822
LIKE NOTHING'S CHANGED.

00:01:45.866 --> 00:01:50.218
NOT TRUE, OF COURSE.
EVERYTHING'S CHANGED.

00:01:50.261 --> 00:01:52.046
IF I BROUGHT MY PARENTS
BACK HERE NOW,

00:01:52.089 --> 00:01:54.135
THEY PROBABLY WOULDN'T RECOGNIZE
ANY OF IT.

00:01:56.267 --> 00:01:58.400
NOT THE TREES...

00:01:58.443 --> 00:02:01.403
NOT THE RIVER...

00:02:01.446 --> 00:02:04.232
NOT EVEN ME.

00:02:09.150 --> 00:02:12.980
MAYBE WE SHOULD JUST STAY HERE,
HARRY.

00:02:14.329 --> 00:02:16.940
GROW OLD.
[ CHUCKLES SOFTLY ]

00:02:22.250 --> 00:02:26.254
YOU WANTED TO KNOW WHO THE BOY
IN THE PHOTOGRAPH WAS.

00:02:26.297 --> 00:02:27.734
I KNOW.

00:02:27.777 --> 00:02:31.302
GELLERT GRINDELWALD.

00:02:37.787 --> 00:02:41.051
HE'S THE THIEF I SAW
IN GREGOROVITCH'S WAND SHOP.

00:02:41.095 --> 00:02:45.099
SPEAKING OF WHICH,
WHERE IS MY WAND?

00:02:45.142 --> 00:02:49.233
WHERE'S MY WAND,
HERMIONE?

00:02:57.024 --> 00:02:59.548
AS WE WERE LEAVING
GODRIC'S HOLLOW,

00:02:59.591 --> 00:03:02.290
I CAST A CURSE
AND IT REBOUNDED.

00:03:04.248 --> 00:03:05.946
I'M SORRY.

00:03:05.989 --> 00:03:07.817
I TRIED TO MEND IT,
BUT WANDS ARE DIFFERENT.

00:03:07.861 --> 00:03:09.210
IT'S DONE.

00:03:10.777 --> 00:03:12.735
LEAVE ME YOURS.

00:03:12.779 --> 00:03:15.433
GO INSIDE AND GET WARM.

00:03:15.477 --> 00:03:18.001
I'LL TAKE THE LOCKET
AS WELL.

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:31.798
Dumbledore: TRUST ME.

00:04:38.995 --> 00:04:41.824
[ PANTING ]

00:04:56.621 --> 00:04:59.189
LUMOS.

00:05:07.328 --> 00:05:09.765
[ ICE CRACKING ]

00:05:40.013 --> 00:05:41.666
ACCIO SWORD.

00:05:47.411 --> 00:05:49.152
DIFFINDO.

00:05:49.196 --> 00:05:50.980
[ ICE CRACKING,
WATER SPLASHING ]

00:06:16.658 --> 00:06:19.052
[ GASPS ]

00:06:19.095 --> 00:06:20.749
[ BREATHING HEAVILY ]

00:06:24.100 --> 00:06:25.580
[ INHALES DEEPLY ]

00:06:40.508 --> 00:06:42.423
[ MUFFLED GRUNTING ]

